Package: uncovr
Title: Code Coverage for 'testthat' Tests
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gábor", "Csárdi", , "csardi.gabor@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Posit Software, PBC", role = c("cph", "fnd"),
           comment = c(ROR = "03wc8by49"))
  )
Description: Measure the code coverage of the 'R' code of a package,
    while running its 'testthat' tests. Instrumentation is fast, and the
    coverage counters have very low overhead. Reports line and function
    coverage in the terminal.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/gaborcsardi/uncovr
BugReports: https://github.com/gaborcsardi/uncovr/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5)
Imports:
    cli,
    desc,
    pkgbuild,
    pkgload,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    tools,
    utils,
    withr
Suggests:
    pillar
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
